===================================================================

General .gitignore for a Node.js Backend + React (Vite) Frontend

===================================================================

General Ignored Files

---------------------

Operating System files

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

Log files

.log
npm-debug.log
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

IDE/Editor directories

.vscode/
.idea/

Root Level

---------------------

The MOST IMPORTANT file to ignore. Contains all secrets.

.env

Root node_modules (if any are ever installed here)

/node_modules

Backend (Node.js / Express) Specific

------------------------------------

/server/node_modules
/server/.env

Frontend (React / Vite) Specific

--------------------------------

/client/node_modules

Build output folder for Vite

/client/dist

Vite-specific cache directory

/client/.vite

Local environment variables for frontend

/client/.env.local
/client/.env.*.local

Test coverage reports

/client /coverage